# Raw per-attempt agent output committed as evidence — verbatim LLM text,
# not guaranteed to be well-formed JSON on its own (may carry a ```json
# fence, or even preamble text before it — a real run had an attempt start
# with "Now producing the revised plan JSON." before the fence, which is
# exactly the kind of malformed reply the schema-retry loop exists to catch;
# the raw file is kept verbatim as evidence of that, not reformatted).
scripts/agent-pipeline/runs/**/plan.attempt-*.json
scripts/agent-pipeline/runs/**/plan.review-*.json
